{
  "$schema": "./_schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "transcribe.cpp (handy-computer, MIT) as sigil_transcribe.dll: Sigil's sigil_engine ABI v1 shim over transcribe.h with transcribe.cpp and ggml linked statically. Owned by P1-G2; decision record docs/adr/0003b-transcribe-cpp.md. Upstream pin: native/engines/transcribe/UPSTREAM.json (v0.2.4, 4807edaf).",
    "Packs are built locally by native/engines/transcribe/build.ps1 (-Variant cpu,cpu-avx2,cpu-avx512,cuda13[,vulkan with the Vulkan SDK]) and stay 'unpublished' (asset hosting is local-only for now): install them by local import in Models & Runtimes or SIGIL_LOCAL_ASSETS (the zips are found by file name). They are unpinned while unpublished; pin size and sha256 from the build's .zip.sha256 when publishing.",
    "Engine packs follow native_runtime's convention runtime/sigil-<engine>-<variant>: each zip holds sigil_transcribe.dll plus sigil-pack.json (sizes and sha256 of every file, checked before each load). cuda13 imports cudart64_13 / cublas64_13 / cublasLt64_13 from runtime/nvidia-cuda13; GPU variants also need AVX2.",
    "bench/* entries are the spike's measurement models (Hugging Face LFS sha256, pinned to a repo commit). P2 adds the user-facing STT model entries.",
    "Upgrade: bump UPSTREAM.json, then every id's version and zip name here together."
  ],
