      "description": "Runs GGUF speech-to-text models (Qwen3-ASR, Cohere Transcribe, Voxtral, Parakeet, Whisper and more) on NVIDIA GPUs through CUDA 13. Needs driver R580 or newer and a Turing (GTX 16 / RTX 20) or newer GPU; installs the NVIDIA GPU runtime with it.",
